  "text_input": "Patient was apparently alright 3 days back, then developed right-sided chest pain which was insidious in onset, gradually progressive.\nSharp, stabbing type of pain, non-radiating, aggravated on coughing or deep inspiration.\nPain worsens on lying down causing discomfort; relieved on shallow breathing.\nPatient also complains of fever since 3 days, with evening rise of temperature. Associated with chills & rigors, relieved on taking medication, and recurs daily early morning hours (around 3 AM).\nNo history of orthopnea / PND / palpitations / syncope\nNo history of breathlessness / hemoptysis\nNo history of trauma to chest\nNo history of weight loss / contact history\nNo history of night sweats\nNo history of burning micturition / abdominal pain",
